Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing you've got compares to\Nthese guys' righteous hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it, Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is staring\Nyou right in the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing compared to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things like this just don't happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such an outrage would\Nbefall me only in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's the real deal,\Nand you're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this means your\Ngood fortune's run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're through, murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Josuke's been\Nclobbered to a bloody mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given the state of his injuries, it seems\Nthey've been battling a little while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means we're looking at...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one and only Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a bleeder over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone bring over an ambulance\Nand get a stretcher now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can hear me, there's\Nan ambulance on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, you're in very good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be taking you to\Nthe hospital momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay with me, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we were too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira's already turned that\Nmedical lady into a bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.30,0:01:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many fingers am I holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, it's time to use Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware, but I'm not close\Nenough for it to be effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.22,0:01:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this distance,\Nstopping time is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too far away to damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get at least\Nfive meters closer to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's going to hold her\Nhostage as a human bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and blow her up if you're so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fix her faster than\Nyou can say, Deadly Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, just keep your cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira blowing up the hostage\Nis the least of our worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell you before, but\Nhe's been hiding a secret power!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.97,0:02:01.35,Main,Hayato,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's called Bites the Dust, and he can use it to blow away time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:02:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Fights the Dust, and\Nhe can use it to obliterate time!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.14,0:02:09.69,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(135,890)\fs60}Episode 39: {\fs80} Goodbye, Morioh - The Heart of Gold
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.14,0:02:09.69,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(135,890)\fs60}Episode 39: {\fs80} Farewell, Morioh: Town of Golden Hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His ability manifests\Nitself with non-stand users,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.47,0:02:10.56,Main,Hayato,0,0,0,,{\an8}I bet it only works on people who aren't Stand users, like me and that lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,normal people like me and that lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I couldn't talk to\Nyou guys in the other timelines!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only appears when Kira screws\Nthe pooch and runs out of options!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the exact situation\Nwe're in right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's spiraling into the\Ndeepest pits of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's made a bomb that\Nturns back time by one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day just keeps getting worse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful your elegant\Nhand. Its silky smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knuckles and your Zeppeli\Nsoft skin It's so pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd even call it milky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I use your gorgeous\Nhand to caress my cheek?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It soothes my soul and brings\Nrelief to my restless spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was a young boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember discovering Leonardo\Nda Vinci's enigmatic Mona
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa while leafing through a\Ntome of the Master's works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:03:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my first time laying eyes on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beauty before me, well,\Nit aroused something in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gave me a rock-hard cock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cut off her hands and proudly\Ndisplayed the treasures in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I lust to sever your treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, please, what do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, my name is Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had the pleasure of killing 48 beautiful\Nwomen with even more beautiful hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're a special beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will be the only one to have\Never known my true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, this isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bites the Dust is about to activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly, we have to kill him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we let Kira live, everyone here\Nbesides her will be blown to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hatred for you fools\Nhas manifested bites
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dust and you're charging ahead anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how you want it, you\Ncan stop time for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, all I want is for\Nyou to back me into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I'm pushed to the brink,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my stand's power will\Nbe triggered and I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,put you creetins out of\Ncommission permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, stop time already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let him push\NDeadly Queen's switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finally reached\Nmy limit with you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I succeeded!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I activated it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to activate\NBites of Dust yet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I destroyed the antelopers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, my quiet life\Nof freedom could begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is my mind playing tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those birds flew right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never once used it to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time was reversed by one hour, so I\Nshould be on my way to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the devil is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for that matter, when?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put my watch in my breast pocket\Nafter I burned my wrist. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is the watch still\Nbroken? And the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says 8.29.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I activated Bites the Dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.56,0:06:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the watch Hyatel\Nbroke with straight-kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should have returned\Nto its undamaged state.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Kosaku Kawajiri in Rohan's\Nphoto was really Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, the battle's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The great Yoshikage Kira,\Nbested by those he'd spit upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who the hell are you, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forgot about little ol' me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it did happen 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something truly horrible must\Nhave happened to you in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something so harrowing you've lost any\Nand all recollection of what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you another stand user,\Nyou talkative little tart?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the bearer of bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been sent to this\Nplace because you bit it, bub!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no standability!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proof that there's justice\Nin this world and your
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,murderous soul will rot\Nuntil the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have I jogged your memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember how you died?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him do it, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally reached my limit with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mission success!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The primary target has entered the\Nfive meter active range of act three,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S-H-I-T!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release me you insignificant pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum, unleash the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, you're the most\Nreliable guy I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be forever grateful that I was\Nable to come here and get to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close call, but we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Time in.
