Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't beaten me.\NI'll push that button and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what I do bites the dust\Nwill haunt you all down?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.12,0:09:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is far from over\Nbut how he just flew into
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the air don't push that\Nbutton just wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll blow you to hell if I do. I can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out my days in peace\Nand quiet his tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is certainly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna run over the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ambulance just ran over that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came out of nowhere. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull forward, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to get behind the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.77,0:09:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to just lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an instantaneous death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he tried to\Ndive under the ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know there's no excuse\Nfor what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I didn't have a\Nchance to restrain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life can be bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was pinned between\Nthe asphalt and tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The force tore off his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we know the identity of the victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me his name himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an old house in Kotodai\Nbelonging to the Kira family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard there was only one occupant,\Nso we might not have family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think an accident would end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all worked out for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The law would never have been able\Nto give the punishment he deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no better outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:10:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never really got along with my\Ndad when he was still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so, I never thought I'd lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted justice for my dad's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted someone to bring\Nhis killer to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember now, Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how your life was\Nripped away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny how memory works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had just about enough of your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who or what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you didn't have a stand that could\Nmake all of your victims disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, when I was murdered,\Nit was front page news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, does this gash on\Nmy back look familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I was your very first victim,\Nmaybe you forgot to cut off my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.66,0:11:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just not that\Nmemorable to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.10,0:11:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:12:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, you're Reimi Sugimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me right now what you've been\Nplanning here for the past 15 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you get\Nout of showing off your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disgusting wound and revealing\Nyour true identity to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now wait just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the place where one shouldn't\Nlook over their shoulder or else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My old man once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hidden somewhere in this town is a\Npassage for the souls of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me to never look back\Nif I ever found myself there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do so would invite an unspeakable power
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would drag you\Ninto an abyss of misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's just a hunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I get the feeling you only\Nshowed me your back in order to lure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me in front of you so I'd play into\Nyour ghostly hands and turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were trying to trick me,\Nweren't you, my spectral strumpet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you look for me, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would love to see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:13:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's have us a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn that pretty little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think I wouldn't prepare\Nfor you pulling a stunt like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was way more than\Nenough time to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good boy, Arnold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira, your hour\Nof reckoning has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these putrid things?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make whatever this is explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they going to take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to know where they're taking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they going to do? Reimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I doubt we'll be\Nliving in peace and tranquility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, at long last, we can\Nfinally pass on, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really leaving us, Reimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely it wouldn't hurt anything if\Nyou stayed a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you've been like a\Nguardian angel to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine life here without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to stay. Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're very sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Arnold and I have done everything\Nwe set out to accomplish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time's come for us to leave Mariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:14:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, little Rohan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think you're going to cry after\Nwe've gone off to the great beyond?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What reason would I have to miss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You died 15 years ago,\Nmaking you a distant memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.58,0:15:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've said this before, but\Nspirits should really just let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haunting the world of the\Nliving is so out of style.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soul's final resting\Nplace isn't here with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but exploring the uncharted afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.98,0:15:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll say it, alright, but I'm only\Ndoing so because I'll never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I don't want you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's all over, Reimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like everyone showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've all come to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:16:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels weird to say this\Nto the dearly departed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you on the other side, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an extraordinary young woman, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Reimi, thank you so\Nmuch for all you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved this little town when\Nit needed a savior the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saying that, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we saved Mariah, all of us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we draw breath, no one here\Ntoday will ever forget you or your bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, Reimi. Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:16:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he's working overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have been nice\Nif he called, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hayato, you haven't touched your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up before it gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're waiting for me,\NI'll eat when Dad gets home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When dad gets home,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll all sit down and eat together,\Nbecause that's what a family does, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, am I imagining things, or\Nhave you gotten taller lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all was said and done, our little\NMorioh wasn't the town it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monster named Yoshikage\NKira swept in like
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a plague and had his way\Nwith our beloved home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato's mother will no doubt wait\Nfor her husband until the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Shigechi's parents will never stop
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,waiting for their special\Nlittle man to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether a son, daughter,\Nbrother, or sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira's victims belong to parents\Nwho will never give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, that hope will only\Ncause their pain to grow deeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, what can\Nwe do to lessen this burden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will a vile past consume our future,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or will we be able to forge\Nahead unfettered by fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worried about what might\Nhappen when we leave this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am, just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of all of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've had the chance to see how\Ncapable Josuke and his friends are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's one thing I can\Nsay with absolute certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The young people living in this\Ntown are heroes one and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and each one of them\Npossesses a heart of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've the same righteous hearts we\Nwitnessed on our journey to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They carry a spirit of radiance that will\Nfight for true justice above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it in Josuke, as well as the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morio's in good hands with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as they're here, we\Nhave nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there gawking!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me! Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then guess it's time for\Nme to say goodbye to a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great son who's made his\Nfather so very proud Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember that picture of mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't still have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Course I do I put it in my\Nwallet for safe keeping just
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like you told me to ah since\NI can't tell her in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you I wish her all\Nthe happiness in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So funny thing about that picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you I decided to hang on to a piece
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, you shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I'll take it if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just call this gift\N16 years of back allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, think about what\Nyour better half would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.22,0:19:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you took that picture over you?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.75,Main,Joseph,0,0,0,,{\an8}Y-You little brat...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does that cocky punk think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:20:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to see that\Ngolden spirit, old man.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.26,0:20:04.05,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Shining justice mebaete
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.26,0:20:04.05,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Shining justice takes bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's seeing it all\Nthe way to the bank!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take good care of yourself. Help!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.05,0:20:09.68,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Brand-new bed town kosasuru ibuki
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.05,0:20:09.68,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Brand-new bed town feels like a breath of fresh air
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.68,0:20:15.36,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}misaki kara shiokaze, tonneru nuke tettou e
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.68,0:20:15.36,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The cape creates a salty breeze, \Nthrough the tunnel past the tower's beams
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.68,0:20:15.36,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}misaki kara shiokaze, tonneru nukete tou e
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invisible baby's\Nmother was never found.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Joseph Joestar rose to the occasion\Nand began an adventure as a new dad.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.36,0:20:20.61,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}hikareai komichi ni mayoikomu
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.36,0:20:20.61,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Until it's finally drawn in and fades into the town's streets
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo finally\Nfinished a doctoral thesis.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.61,0:20:23.78,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}kokoro ni (kokoro ni)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.61,0:20:23.78,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Within our hearts (Within our hearts)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He began on a species\Nof starfish he found.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.78,0:20:27.95,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}tokekomu kage
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.78,0:20:27.95,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Lurks a hidden shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on a beach in Mariah, earning him his PhD.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.95,0:20:31.37,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}terasu ogon no spirits
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.95,0:20:31.37,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The golden spirits will illuminate the way
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.95,0:20:31.37,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}terasu ougon no spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always coming in here and eating\Nall my food like he owns the place!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.37,0:20:37.88,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}sore wa mamorinuku hikari
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.37,0:20:37.88,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Toward that light we must protect
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.37,0:20:37.88,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}sore wa mamori nuku hikari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just drink his juice.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.88,0:20:42.88,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Let the voice of love take you higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.77,0:20:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was making Bind boxes for\Nus and lost track of the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.88,0:20:49.22,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}atsumaru chikara de toki sae koete
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.88,0:20:49.22,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Our powers combined will help us surpass even time
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.88,0:20:49.22,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}atsumaru chikara de tokisae koete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you actually made us a special lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so thoughtful.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.22,0:20:54.10,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}1999 Bizarre Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lunchtime can't come soon enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.10,0:20:59.77,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}meguru yuuki de ikiru machi
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.10,0:20:59.77,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Living in this town surrounded by courage
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.77,0:21:03.70,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Great Days!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tasty!
