Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're cookin', let the healing begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fight it, let the food carry you!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.08,0:21:18.84,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Song of praises hibikase
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.08,0:21:18.84,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Song of praises rings far and wide
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this works, you'll be a normal\Nold dad again, isn't that great?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.84,0:21:24.51,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Brand-new up town surechigau keshiki
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.84,0:21:24.51,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Brand-new up town feel it coursing through the land
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that didn't work.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.51,0:21:30.18,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}kumo no kirema ni sasu, hikari ga hora furisosogi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.51,0:21:30.18,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Watching the silver lining in the clouds, \Na brilliant light comes pouring in
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My skin is so smooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out my refreshed eyes, the\Nfood hair is out of this world!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.18,0:21:35.39,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}inishie no komichi e sasoikomu
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.18,0:21:35.39,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And is drawn into that familiar old alleyway
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.43,0:21:36.31,Main,Yuuya,0,0,0,,{\pos(1240,1055)}Right? I'm so much sexier than before, \NI don't even know what to do with my bad self!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it though?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.41,0:21:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this food, I'm even\Nmore stunningly gorgeous now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do with myself?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.39,0:21:38.69,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}kirameki (kirameki)
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.39,0:21:38.69,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Our glimmering (Our glimmering)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're simply radiant, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're practically beaming.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.69,0:21:42.82,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}michibiku machi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.69,0:21:42.82,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Town will show the way {I'm a little confused by this. Is the town leading random people those with golden spirits? Or is it leading people with golden spirits to something?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you say I'm a dazzling\Ndish of devilish delights?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.82,0:21:46.24,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}tagiru ougon no spirits
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.82,0:21:46.24,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To those with golden spirits
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.24,0:21:52.74,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}sore wa hateshinai kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.24,0:21:52.74,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Who share an eternal bond
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, amigo mio, until next we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw Ko holding hands with a girl,\Nand she was drop-dead gorgeous. Oh, my!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.74,0:21:57.67,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Let the joy of love give you an answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure he never mentioned\Nanything to me about a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.67,0:22:03.92,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}wakare no toki sae kudakenuishi de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.67,0:22:03.92,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}With a meaning which is unbreakable even when we're apart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear? Mr. Kira\Nwent missing. Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're saying they found him\Ndead without a face. How freaky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.92,0:22:09.09,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}1999 Bizarre Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just how are you going\Nto make this up to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.09,0:22:18.62,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}jibun norikoe tsukami tore mirai
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.09,0:22:18.62,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Surpass yourself and take hold of the future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.55,0:22:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stupid can you kicked Spray\NJuice all over my brand new manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I want to know what you're\Ngoing to do to make this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, kid, cry me a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five,\Nsix, seven, eight, nine, ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.58,0:22:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure spend a lot of time\Nstaring out into the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.62,0:22:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see anything cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just see plain old Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.02,0:22:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly, isn't it grand?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.18,0:22:54.14,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Let the voice of love take you higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find this town interesting,\Nquite interesting indeed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.14,0:23:00.69,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}atsumaru chikara de toki sae koete
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.14,0:23:00.69,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Our powers combined will help us surpass even time
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.14,0:23:00.69,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}atsumaru chikara de tokisae koete
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, for most, the summer of\N1999 slipped away like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peace had come to Morioh, making\Nfor some pretty great days.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.82,0:23:06.65,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Let the joy of love give you an answer!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.65,0:23:13.16,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Wakare no toki sae kudakenuishi de
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.65,0:23:13.16,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}With a meaning which is unbreakable even when we're apart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.29,0:23:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Rohan got caught\Nshoplifting from Kamehuu.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.16,0:23:18.00,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}1999 Bizarre Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.28,0:23:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a dim shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that's freaking crazy, if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.00,0:23:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by it?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.00,0:23:26.55,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kawasu yuki ga umu sanka
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.00,0:23:26.55,Part 4 Insert English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Our shared courage will give rise to a song of praise
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.60,0:23:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't know for sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.12,0:23:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, come on, let's bounce.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.55,0:23:30.63,Part 4 Insert Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Great Days!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.93,0:23:41.35,Episode 39 The End,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\pos(1672,846)\be(0.3)}The End

